WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Soft instrumental music] Life starts with a little.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A little care. A living world. One leaf at a time.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Same space. New feeling.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Come home. Exhale.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Make room for life.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Planto. A little green. A different feeling.
